window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-0cb067d37bbd335d"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"set-up-a-project-teammate\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">设置项目协作助手</h1> <p>为一个项目配备专属、了解上下文的协作助手。</p> <p>为单个项目或工作流设置 ChatGPT Work 专属任务。它可以查看相关消息、文档、决策和截止日期；按计划跟踪重要变化、准备下一步，并在采取行动前等待批准。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>发布项目、客户账户、活动或计划的决策分散在多个已连接工作工具中。</li> <li>需要专属任务跟踪进度、阻塞事项、负责人和后续步骤的项目。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看与项目相关的消息、决策和后续事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">teams（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看 Teams 消息、项目决策和待处理事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail（需联网）</a></td> <td>查找与项目相关的电子邮件、待回复内容和承诺事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/outlook-email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">outlook-email（需联网）</a></td> <td>查找与项目相关的 Outlook 电子邮件和未完成事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看项目里程碑、会议和会前准备事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看项目简介、笔记、计划和决策历史。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>设置我的项目协作助手</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请作为我在 [project or workstream] 项目中的专属协作助手。只关注这个项目。如果项目范围不明确，请先询问我，不要查看无关工作。\n\n请审阅你可以访问的相关消息、电子邮件、日历事件、文档、笔记和项目跟踪工具。弄清楚我们要完成什么、涉及哪些人员、已经做出了哪些决定、当前截止日期是什么，以及还有哪些事项未解决。如果缺少某个来源，请明确告诉我，不要猜测。\n\n请先提供一份简明的项目简介，包含：\n\n- 目标和当前状态；\n\n- 重要决策、负责人和截止日期；\n\n- 发生了哪些变化；\n\n- 阻塞事项、依赖项和未解答的问题；以及\n\n- 能推动项目进展的下一步。\n\n如果有来源链接，请附上链接；提及旧请求之前，先检查最新回复；区分已确认事实与假设。请将上下文限制在这个项目内。\n\n随着项目推进，帮助我研究问题、准备会议、审阅草稿和撰写后续消息。如果我要求你按计划回来检查，请留意有实质意义的变化。\n\n发送消息、编辑文档、安排工作、共享信息或作出承诺之前，先征求我的同意。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">设置工作首席幕僚（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"what-to-expect\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">你可以期待什么</h2> <p>为 ChatGPT Work 指定一个要关注的项目。专属协作助手可以检查影响项目的消息、文档、会议、决策和未解答问题，然后帮助你决定下一步。如果你希望它继续关注项目，可以添加定时检查。</p> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">工作首席幕僚（本地尚未收录）</a>会关注你的各项优先事务，而项目协作助手则专注于某个发布项目、客户账户、计划或活动。</p> <p>根据项目选择适合的使用界面：</p> <ul> <li><strong>ChatGPT 网页版：</strong>让协作助手专注于已连接的项目消息、文档、会议和跟踪工具。即使你的笔记本电脑关机，<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">定时检查（本地尚未收录）</a>仍可持续关注这些来源。</li> <li><strong>ChatGPT 桌面应用：</strong>让协作助手访问本地项目文件和应用。你也可以让工作首席幕僚创建独立任务、为其准备简介并协调后续工作。如果<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">定时检查（本地尚未收录）</a>需要本地文件或桌面工具，请保持电脑开机并让应用持续运行。</li> </ul> <p>项目检查及后续跟进可以如下所示：</p> <p><strong>项目状态：</strong>面向客户的发布文案已获批准，准备度审查已列入日程。</p> <p><strong>未解答的问题：</strong>发布清单缺少文档链接，安全审批也尚未确认。</p> <p><strong>下一步：</strong>跟进最终链接，并确认安全审查是否会影响发布。</p> <p><strong>跟进草稿：</strong>“你好，想在准备度审查前确认一下最终文档链接。它已经可以加入发布清单了吗？还是还有事项阻碍添加？”这条消息尚未发送。</p> <p><strong>项目定时检查：</strong>每 30 分钟检查一次项目讨论串、清单和准备度会议。只报告有实质意义的变化，不联系任何人，也不更新跟踪工具。</p> <p><a id=\"what-you-can-use-a-teammate-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">协作助手可以做什么</h2> <ul> <li><strong>推进发布项目。</strong>关注项目频道、发布清单、审批、素材和发布时间。提前标记缺少的材料和待定决策，避免它们变成阻塞事项。</li> <li><strong>制作播客或视频。</strong>跟踪脚本、录音、审阅意见、敏感素材、剪辑请求和发布截止日期。</li> <li><strong>交付文档或网站。</strong>跟踪拉取请求、审阅评论、预览部署、产品变化和待完成的发布审批。</li> <li><strong>管理客户项目。</strong>将客户对话、会议笔记、承诺、未解答问题和下一步跟进集中管理。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"set-up-your-teammate\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">设置协作助手</h2> <ol> <li>选择你希望协作助手关注的项目、计划或客户账户。</li> <li>连接或提供与该工作相关的消息、电子邮件、日历、文档和跟踪工具。</li> <li>使用起始提示词创建一个专属任务。</li> <li>检查初始项目简介，并补充缺失的上下文。</li> <li>在同一任务中继续处理决策、研究、会议准备和后续消息草稿。</li> <li>如果希望协作助手持续查看项目更新，可以添加定时检查。</li> </ol> <p>请让项目任务始终聚焦。发送消息、更新文档、更改跟踪工具、安排工作或作出承诺之前，ChatGPT 都应先征求你的同意。</p> <p><a id=\"start-with-your-chief-of-staff\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">从工作首席幕僚开始</h2> <p>在桌面应用中，你可以让<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">工作首席幕僚（本地尚未收录）</a>创建项目协作助手并为其准备简介。这样，新任务会获得相关上下文，而你的首席幕僚对话不会变成另一个项目工作区。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a separate teammate task for the project we just discussed. Brief it on the goal, relevant messages and documents, decisions, owners, deadlines, blockers, and open questions. Share only the context needed for that project. Tell me where to find the task, and don't send messages, change documents, or make commitments without my approval.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">为我们刚刚讨论的项目创建一个独立的协作任务。向它交代目标、相关消息和文档、已作出的决定、负责人、截止日期、阻碍和待解答问题。只分享该项目所需的上下文。告诉我在哪里找到这个任务；未经我批准，不要发送消息、更改文档或作出承诺。</div></div> <p><strong>查看现有协作助手</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check on the existing project teammate we discussed. Tell me what changed, what's blocked, what it's waiting on, and what I need to review. Don't create a duplicate task or take action without my approval.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">查看我们讨论过的现有项目协作任务。告诉我发生了什么变化、有哪些阻碍、它在等待什么，以及哪些内容需要我审阅。不要创建重复任务，也不要在未经我批准的情况下采取行动。</div></div> <p><strong>添加项目定时检查</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check this project's messages, documents, tracker, and upcoming meetings every 30 minutes. Tell me when an owner, deadline, approval, blocker, or decision changes. Stay quiet when nothing meaningful has changed. Don't repeat resolved items, send messages, or change project documents without my approval.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">每 30 分钟检查这个项目的消息、文档、跟踪表和即将召开的会议。当负责人、截止日期、批准状态、阻碍或决定发生变化时，告诉我。如果没有实质性变化，就保持安静。不要重复已经解决的事项；未经我批准，不要发送消息或更改项目文档。</div></div> <p>连接来源和定时任务是否可用，取决于你的套餐和工作区设置。项目任务协调功能可在桌面应用中使用。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"set-up-a-project-teammate\">Set up a project teammate</h1> <p>Keep one project moving with a dedicated, context-aware teammate.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT Work a dedicated task for one project or workstream. It can review relevant messages, documents, decisions, and deadlines; track meaningful changes on a schedule; prepare the next step; and wait for approval before taking action.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Launches, customer accounts, events, or initiatives with decisions spread across connected work tools.</li> <li>Projects that need a dedicated task to track progress, blockers, owners, and next steps.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Review the messages, decisions, and follow-ups relevant to the project.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">teams (online)</a></td> <td>Review Teams messages, project decisions, and open follow-ups.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail (online)</a></td> <td>Find project-related email, pending replies, and commitments.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/outlook-email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">outlook-email (online)</a></td> <td>Find project-related Outlook email and outstanding requests.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar (online)</a></td> <td>Check project milestones, meetings, and preparation.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Review the project brief, notes, plans, and decision history.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Set up my project teammate</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Be my dedicated teammate for [project or workstream]. Focus only on that project. If the project isn't clear, ask me before reviewing unrelated work.\n\nReview the relevant messages, email, calendar events, documents, notes, and project trackers available to you. Establish what we're trying to accomplish, who's involved, what's already been decided, the current deadlines, and what's still open. Tell me when a source is missing instead of guessing.\n\nStart with a concise project brief:\n\n- the goal and current state;\n- important decisions, owners, and deadlines;\n- what's changed;\n- blockers, dependencies, and unanswered questions; and\n- the next step that would move the project forward.\n\nLink to your sources when available, check the latest replies before surfacing old requests, and distinguish confirmed facts from assumptions. Keep your context limited to this project.\n\nHelp me research questions, prepare meetings, review drafts, and write follow-ups as the project progresses. If I ask you to check back on a schedule, watch for meaningful changes.\n\nAsk before sending messages, editing documents, scheduling work, sharing information, or making commitments.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Set up a work chief of staff (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"what-to-expect\">What to expect</h2> <p>Give ChatGPT Work one project to focus on. A dedicated teammate can check the messages, documents, meetings, decisions, and open questions that affect that project, then help you decide what to do next. Add a scheduled check when you want it to keep watching the project.</p> <p>Unlike a <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">work chief of staff (not in this local snapshot)</a>, which watches across your priorities, a project teammate stays focused on a specific launch, customer account, initiative, or event.</p> <p>Choose the surface that fits your project:</p> <ul> <li><strong>ChatGPT on the web:</strong> Keep a teammate focused on connected project messages, documents, meetings, and trackers. A <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">scheduled check (not in this local snapshot)</a> can keep watching those sources when your laptop is off.</li> <li><strong>ChatGPT desktop app:</strong> Give a teammate access to local project files and apps. You can also ask your chief of staff to create, brief, and coordinate the teammate as a separate task. Keep your computer on and the app running if a <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">scheduled check (not in this local snapshot)</a> needs local files or desktop tools.</li> </ul> <p>Here's what a project check and follow-up can look like:</p> <p><strong>Project status:</strong> The customer-facing launch copy is approved, and the readiness review is on the calendar.</p> <p><strong>Open questions:</strong> The launch checklist is missing the documentation link, and security approval hasn't been confirmed.</p> <p><strong>Next step:</strong> Check on the final link and confirm whether the security review blocks launch.</p> <p><strong>Draft follow-up:</strong> “Hey, checking on the final docs link before the readiness review. Is it ready to add to the launch checklist, or is anything still blocking it?” The message remains unsent.</p> <p><strong>Project heartbeat:</strong> Check the launch thread, checklist, and readiness meeting every 30 minutes. Report meaningful changes without contacting anyone or updating the tracker.</p> <h2 id=\"what-you-can-use-a-teammate-for\">What you can use a teammate for</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Run a launch.</strong> Watch the project channel, launch checklist, approvals, assets, and release timing. Flag missing materials and decisions before they become blockers.</li> <li><strong>Produce a podcast or video.</strong> Track scripts, recordings, review notes, sensitive footage, edit requests, and publishing deadlines.</li> <li><strong>Ship documentation or a website.</strong> Track pull requests, review comments, preview deployments, product changes, and outstanding publication approvals.</li> <li><strong>Manage a customer project.</strong> Keep the account conversation, meeting notes, commitments, open questions, and the next follow-up in one place.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"set-up-your-teammate\">Set up your teammate</h2> <ol> <li>Choose the project, initiative, or customer account you want the teammate to focus on.</li> <li>Connect or provide the messages, email, calendar, documents, and trackers relevant to that work.</li> <li>Start a dedicated task using the starter prompt.</li> <li>Review the initial project brief and correct any missing context.</li> <li>Continue using the same task for decisions, research, meeting preparation, and draft follow-ups.</li> <li>Add a heartbeat when you want the teammate to keep checking for project updates.</li> </ol> <p>Keep the project task focused. ChatGPT should ask before sending messages, updating documents, changing a tracker, scheduling work, or making commitments.</p> <h2 id=\"start-with-your-chief-of-staff\">Start with your chief of staff</h2> <p>In the desktop app, you can ask your <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/daily-work-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">work chief of staff (not in this local snapshot)</a> to create and brief the project teammate. That gives the new task the relevant context without turning your chief-of-staff thread into another project workspace.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a separate teammate task for the project we just discussed. Brief it on the goal, relevant messages and documents, decisions, owners, deadlines, blockers, and open questions. Share only the context needed for that project. Tell me where to find the task, and don't send messages, change documents, or make commitments without my approval.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Check on an existing teammate</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check on the existing project teammate we discussed. Tell me what changed, what's blocked, what it's waiting on, and what I need to review. Don't create a duplicate task or take action without my approval.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Add a project heartbeat</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check this project's messages, documents, tracker, and upcoming meetings every 30 minutes. Tell me when an owner, deadline, approval, blocker, or decision changes. Stay quiet when nothing meaningful has changed. Don't repeat resolved items, send messages, or change project documents without my approval.\n</code></pre> <p>Connected sources and scheduled tasks depend on your plan and workspace settings. Project-task coordination is available in the desktop app.</p>"};
